{"title":"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If all alligators are ferocious creatures and some creepy crawlers are alligators, which statement(s) must be true?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/b/72b807a06e111f8fdb87f07064fff3c3cfc5fee3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textrm{I. All alligators are creepy crawlers.}\\]\" width=\"257\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/3/c73e126dd37b7f7dd433101545605fcbc09b70ab.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textrm{II. Some ferocious creatures are creepy crawlers.}\\]\" width=\"349\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/0/f40481a58c634ac2f60a79caafb1ed5aebeb3240.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textrm{III. Some alligators are not creepy crawlers.}\\]\" width=\"316\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/0/940ca602a1773aec67280e15854917714cf4e605.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ \\text{I only} \\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ \\text{II only} \\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ \\text{III only} \\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ \\text{II and III only} \\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ \\text{None must be true}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"685\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Statement I could be false.  A possible situation in which statement I is false is if the only creatures are two alligators, one of which is a creepy crawler and one of which is not.\n</p><p>Statement II must be true.  Since some creepy crawlers are alligators and all alligators are ferocious creatures, it follows that some creepy crawlers are ferocious creatures, and thus some ferocious creatures are creepy crawlers.\n</p><p>Statement III could be false.  A possible situation in which statement III is false is if the only creature is a creepy crawler which is also an alligator.\n</p><p>Therefore, only <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/d/1dd276730dc59fa28a998986a0bcee92d169d8c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\text{ II only}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"96\" height=\"30\" /> is necessarily true.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 10\">2000 AMC 10</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Answer_Key\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_22\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_2\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_6\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_9\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_11\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_12\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2000 AMC 10 Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2000_AMC_10_Problems/Problem_13\" ti